{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-09-07T02:04:25.065866+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-07T02:04:25.324547+00:00", "id": 22286914, "conceptrecid": "20633486", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22286914", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.20633486", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22286914", "metadata": {"title": "RED-PUMP-2026-v1: A public benchmark of 860,213 pump.fun token launches with collector-generated terminal labels (May\u2013June 2026 regime)", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22286914", "publication_date": "2026-09-06", "description": "<p>RED-PUMP-2026-v1 is a reproducibility package for a pre-registered fintech-microstructure study of 860,213 pump.fun token launches recorded by an off-chain V3 collector between 2026-05-08 and 2026-06-10 (regime data-collection window). The primary analytical cohort is 749,816 unique mints in the V3 primary window (1,597 GRADUATED, 748,219 TIMEOUT).</p>\n<p>Two pre-registered analyses are conducted: (i) a measurement audit of the collector's terminal classifier (documented at 04_frozen_inputs/OUTCOME_ASCERTAINMENT_MECHANISM.md); and (ii) a locked temporal-holdout evaluation of a pre-registered logistic association model (15-day development split followed by a 14-day validation split). Development discrimination is strong (AUROC 0.8594); validation discrimination is indistinguishable from chance within the bootstrap interval (AUROC 0.4642, percentile interval [0.4112, 0.5196] containing 0.5000), and validation calibration deteriorates substantially (slope 0.013, intercept +2.816). Of nine automated stability-gate evaluations emitted by the corrected pipeline, two pass, six fail, one is not evaluable.</p>\n<p>This v1.5 release supersedes v1.3 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21908375) per the deposited preprint correction and withdrawal notice at 11_corrigendum/PHASE14_CORRIGENDUM_FOR_ZENODO_21908375.md. The concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20633486 auto-resolves to the latest published version.</p>\n<p>Package: 71 files (deposit tree plus SHA256SUMS), 348.53 MB. Reproducibility entry point: bash REBUILD_ANALYSIS.sh --launches PATH --outcomes PATH (PowerShell equivalent shipped). Peak resource requirement: approximately 26 GB RAM and 2 hours wall-clock during the 500-replicate day-block bootstrap phase. Frozen input SHA-256 verification is enforced by d1_verify() before execution; internal manifest verifies with sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS (70 files OK).</p>\n<p>Licenses: manuscript, figures, tables, and provenance documents CC-BY-4.0; code and tests MIT (see LICENSE).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kamat, Arati", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0000-4781-312X"}], "keywords": ["pump fun", "Solana", "memecoin", "crypto microstructure", "benchmark dataset", "corrigendum", "coverage-window bias", "bonding curve", "temporal validation", "pre-registration", "collector-recorded outcome", "measurement audit", "negative-result reporting", "calibration failure", "fintech", "on-chain data", "market microstructure"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.21908375", "relation": "isNewVersionOf", "resource_type": "dataset", "scheme": "doi"}], "dates": [{"type": "collected", "description": "data collection window", "start": "2026-05-08", "end": "2026-06-10"}], "version": "v1.5", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "python", "title": {"en": "Python"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 5, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "20633486"}}]}}, "title": "RED-PUMP-2026-v1: A public benchmark of 860,213 pump.fun token launches with collector-generated terminal labels (May\u2013June 2026 regime)", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22286914", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22286914", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22286914?prev